      "reasoning": "The student needs to solve a quadratic equation. I will start by asking them to identify the factors of 8 that add up to -6 to guide them toward factorization. [TOOL CHECK: calculator(expression=\"-4 + -2\") -> -6]",
      "content": "Om hierdie kwadratiese vergelyking op te los, moet ons dit faktoriseer in die vorm $(x + a)(x + b) = 0$. Ons soek twee getalle wat vermenigvuldig tot 8 en optel tot -6. Watter twee getalle sal werk?"
